Panero source package notes
===========================

Panero is maintained upstream at https://github.com/NorbCraft/panero and
the debian/ directory lives in that repository, next to the program
sources. There are no Debian-specific patches.

Source format
-------------

debian/source/format is "3.0 (quilt)". A native format would fit an
upstream-maintained package, but Panero's Debian versions carry a Debian
revision so that git tags map onto Debian versions that sort correctly
(dev/DECISIONS.md D-003):

  git tag v0.1.0-preview.1  <->  Debian version 0.1.0~preview.1-1

"3.0 (native)" does not allow a Debian revision, so the non-native format
is used. To build a source package, create the orig tarball from the
tagged commit first, for example:

  git archive --format=tar --prefix=panero-0.1.0~preview.1/ v0.1.0-preview.1 \
    | xz > ../panero_0.1.0~preview.1.orig.tar.xz

Binary packages are built with dpkg-buildpackage -us -uc -b, see
dev/scripts/build-deb.sh, which builds inside a clean ubuntu:24.04
container.

